msgctxt "77\t160"
msgid "It's been a while, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164\t235"
msgid "What are you doing down here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "245\t384"
msgid ""
"Looking into a family matter regarding\\n"
"the land for the Okinawa resort deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "385\t468"
msgid "You're involved in this resort business?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "471\t499"
msgid "In a way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "501\t670"
msgid ""
"To be more specific, the ones responsible\\n"
"for the situation I'm confronted with..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "683\t830"
msgid "Are a small Okinawa-based offshoot of the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832\t884"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "886\t1044"
msgid ""
"That piece of the Tojo you're talkin' about...\\n"
"Is it the Tamashiro?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1049\t1091"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1094\t1247"
msgid ""
"The Tamashiro Family was originally founded\\n"
"to give us a foothold on the island."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1254\t1514"
msgid ""
"But now they've gone behind our backs and started\\n"
"buying up the land here for use in the resort deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1529\t1657"
msgid "What do the Tamashiro stand to gain from that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1677\t1737"
msgid "As it turns out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1741\t1963"
msgid ""
"Minister Suzuki, of the resort program, asked them to\\n"
"scoop up every patch of crucial real estate in his stead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2003\t2203"
msgid ""
"After all, his plan can't move forward without\\n"
"a certain amount of land to build on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2214\t2310"
msgid "So that's what they're up to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2317\t2583"
msgid ""
"Yes. In order to get the land he required,\\n"
"Suzuki-san needed a local organization on his side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2600\t2720"
msgid ""
"And the Tamashiro Family just so\\n"
"happened to fit the bill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2737\t2966"
msgid ""
"I see. But that doesn't explain\\n"
"why you came here yourself, Daigo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3005\t3156"
msgid ""
"It seems the Tamashiro are using some\\n"
"questionable methods to get a hold of the land."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3186\t3325"
msgid ""
"In some cases, they've even resorted to\\n"
"stealing the deeds from their rightful owners."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3342\t3502"
msgid ""
"Is that why they abducted my Saki?\\n"
"To trade her for some scrap of paper?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3509\t3573"
msgid "Most likely, yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3576\t3820"
msgid ""
"They knew how much you cared for the girl,\\n"
"and intended to use that affection against you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3831\t4011"
msgid ""
"Those Tamashiro assholes...\\n"
"Not a shred of humanity, the lot of 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4026\t4208"
msgid ""
"Allowing them to keep employing\\n"
"those tactics would only lead to trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4237\t4390"
msgid ""
"Imagine the scandal if the public knew\\n"
"yakuza were involved in the resort deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4395\t4568"
msgid ""
"Both it and the proposed military expansion\\n"
"would find themselves at extreme risk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4603\t4751"
msgid ""
"Tamiya-san from the Ministry of Defense\\n"
"personally requested that I intervene."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4766\t4826"
msgid "Interesting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4844\t5068"
msgid ""
"The truth of it is, the resort deal and\\n"
"the proposed military base are a linked pair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5082\t5139"
msgid "Meaning what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5148\t5393"
msgid ""
"You can't have one without the other.\\n"
"If one fails, both fail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5423\t5564"
msgid ""
"Were the resort to be canceled, for example,\\n"
"only the base would remain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5566\t5675"
msgid ""
"But public opinion would never\\n"
"support it on its own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5695\t5910"
msgid ""
"In that sense, the resort's success is just as vital\\n"
"to Tamiya-san as that of his own bill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5937\t5997"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6009\t6320"
msgid ""
"And that's why Tamiya sent you down here.\\n"
"He needs you to keep things from boiling over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6322\t6390"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6401\t6595"
msgid ""
"This particular visit was requested by Toma-kun here.\\n"
"He asked that I accompany Tamiya-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6612\t6790"
msgid ""
"I'm Minister Tamiya's personal secretary,\\n"
"Shoyo Toma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6802\t7016"
msgid ""
"Kid like you workin' for the Minister of Defense?\\n"
"That's some impressive shit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7018\t7190"
msgid ""
"Not at all. I'm merely tasked with\\n"
"carrying out the Minister's orders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7203\t7450"
msgid ""
"Hold on. If you stop the Tamashiro from buying\\n"
"the land, they'd have nowhere to build the resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7470\t7650"
msgid "Not to mention Tamiya's military base."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7666\t7845"
msgid ""
"Indeed. We hope to attain the land through\\n"
"negotiation with the locals, not threats."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7861\t7980"
msgid "Why do all this for just one bill?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8001\t8121"
msgid ""
"This base would be a major international success,\\n"
"far outweighing some trivial little resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8123\t8280"
msgid "A triumph befitting of the next prime minister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8304\t8383"
msgid "So it's all politics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8389\t8575"
msgid ""
"As for the Tojo Clan, we usually stay out\\n"
"of the business of our families."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8590\t8785"
msgid ""
"But were this to become a scandal,\\n"
"it would attract unwanted police attention."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8797\t8978"
msgid ""
"We absolutely can't allow that to happen.\\n"
"Hence why I'm here now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8995\t9080"
msgid "So that's what's going on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9105\t9400"
msgid ""
"But I had no idea your orphanage was being\\n"
"threatened, Kiryu-san. It came as quite a shock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9429\t9654"
msgid ""
"Guess that means you're not gonna have to\\n"
"part with your land. That's a win in my book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9657\t9715"
msgid "I suppose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9732\t9925"
msgid ""
"That may be true for the moment,\\n"
"but your time is not infinite."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9953\t10127"
msgid ""
"I will do whatever it takes to ensure\\n"
"this resort deal meets with success."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10139\t10264"
msgid ""
"Whaddya mean?\\n"
"I thought you were in Tamiya's corner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10268\t10385"
msgid "Shouldn't you be worrying about the base?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10408\t10653"
msgid ""
"I'm an Okinawa native, myself... so it pains me\\n"
"to see my beloved home slowly fade into obscurity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10668\t10945"
msgid ""
"If we fail to bring in the resources this resort\\n"
"promises, our island will die a prolonged, agonizing death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10988\t11235"
msgid ""
"I may work under Minister Tamiya, yes,\\n"
"but I'll do what I must to support my people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11308\t11392"
msgid "Toma-san, was it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11400\t11442"
msgid "That's correct."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11446\t11706"
msgid ""
"If you're really a local, you should know\\n"
"people don't want your damn resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11773\t11880"
msgid ""
"I used to think it wouldn't be so bad\\n"
"if it was bringing in the cash..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11884\t11990"
msgid "But I was dead wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11994\t12192"
msgid ""
"What people here really care about is keepin'\\n"
"the Okinawa they love just the way it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12230\t12495"
msgid ""
"As if that matters in Tokyo. To them we're\\n"
"nothing more than an insignificant speck of earth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12553\t12796"
msgid ""
"But I'll do whatever it takes to change that.\\n"
"Even if it means making sacrifices."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12814\t12928"
msgid "Sacrifices like our land, I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12948\t13112"
msgid "Correct. Okinawa is famous for its abundant beaches."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13123\t13288"
msgid ""
"There should be no harm in laying claim\\n"
"to a few acres of that abundance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13299\t13533"
msgid ""
"So the ends justify the means, huh?\\n"
"Spoken like a true politician."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13536\t13701"
msgid ""
"But y'know... People might not be\\n"
"as willing to budge as you hope."
msgstr ""